Z||000007||hugh||02-03-2001||07:15 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BAM-BAM:<BR><B>  That's a sad thing. I really thought we here on the forum could make a difference. I guess that most of us are to caught up in our lives to care about anyone else. That's the new world society, everyone for themselves and screw the rest. TO those who have shown the generosity to help Anthony, my hat is off to you. To those who felt that he wasn't deserving of mere pocket change, GOD help you in your time of need. <P> BYE, B2 OUT!<P> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Did it ever occur to you that there are lots of people and animals in this world that could benefit much more from that pocket change than someone injured in an accident that is fortunate enough to be in a modern hospital with all the medical help he needs.I am truly sorry that he was injured,but because he drives one of our cars is no reason that I,for one,will divert any funds I have from where I believe they will do the most good.I resent the inference that because I and many others don't choose to help in this case that we are selfish and as you infered think only of ourselves.     <BR>||||reg||1
