Z||000027||firstfiero||02-05-2001||08:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BAM-BAM:<BR><B>  That's a sad thing. I really thought we here on the forum could make a difference. I guess that most of us are to caught up in our lives to care about anyone else. That's the new world society, everyone for themselves and screw the rest. TO those who have shown the generosity to help Anthony, my hat is off to you. To those who felt that he wasn't deserving of mere pocket change, GOD help you in your time of need. <P> BYE, B2 OUT!<P> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>     I gotta say I thought that was a crappy thing to say also. Just because some of us have other things we must focus our attention on does not make us bad people. To those giving to the fund I find nothing wrong with helping out a fellow fiero driver. To those who judge the rest of us because we either can't or choose not to shame on you.   86se||||reg||8
