Z||000030||stsmithgt||02-06-2001||07:04 PM||||Tagging what seems to be lack of interest in other people problems as selfish may describe what you see, but now what does term selfishness consist of?  It doesn't always mean it's for your own pleasure or profit.  Here's what could be a typical example of selfishness:  I usually pay bills towards the end of the month.  I thought I'd be writing an extra check to send to someone I didn't know.  I did write an extra check, but is was to take that Cadillac imprint off of my car since it's the only car I own.  I'll probably end up spending about $3000.00 easy in two months that I didn't expect.  I almost thought I'd have to dig into a meager retirement fund to make it through this incident I'm in, but I think I'm going to be able to avoid that.  That doesn't leave me much to spread around.  I wonder what my car looks like now?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/legotoy.jpg"> I suppose others have similar problems that need to be tend to before helping others.  That reminds me, I'm donating a bunch of items this friday.  Thanks for the reminder.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  How do you spell sarible palsy anyway?  I know I'm not selfish as I could be that's for sure.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Is donating $$$.$$ to the NRA or ILA selfish?  Trying to save the second amendment a generous thing to do isn't it?<p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 02-06-2001).]||||reg||9
Z||000031||fldevel||02-06-2001||11:29 PM||||hey .. i rapped my fiero around a tree due to a drunk running me off the road .. it looks a bout as bad as that car in the pic .. i dident get hurt in witch i thank god .. but i have bought 3 more fieros sence then and moved on ..i did not expect any support from my friends that owned fieros .. all i cared about is that they cared enough to be concerned about me ... now put yourself in his shoes .. what would he be saying to all of you right now <P><BR>now whose really the victum of what here ??||||reg||1
